  "name": "Чутьё земли",
  "title": "Чутьё земли",
  "prompt": "One ground-listening gesture. Slowly spread the free claws and gently flatten that palm on the ground directly beneath its current position. Sink the low head and lean the ear toward the planted palm as if listening through the earth. Pause in this weighted listening pose; the shoulder and hump give one small responsive tremor. Ease the weight back, curl the fingers and return to the exact original crouch. The club remains low across the belly. No ground slam, hit, forceful impact, weapon swing, projectile or magic effect. Keep both short feet planted at the same spot and the spine deeply hunched, never stand taller or turn around. Preserve the small body size, simple pixel clusters and torn clothing. Fixed camera and scale, transparent background, whole figure and club within the canvas with empty edge margins.",
